{"recommendationid": "22559102", "author": {"steamid": "76561198247834880", "personaname": "Nelumy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Nelumy/", "num_games_owned": 106, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 6427, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2818, "last_played": 1514460180, "avatar": "b17e7bc6f233777a5120b04bf6b6a872ad87d5c5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Alien Swarm is a super team-based game with many weapons and funny extras. The main game has only one campaign with seven missions, but they are very intense and if you are finished with them, you toggle the difficulty for a harder challenge. And if the story went boring, you can play on dedicated servers and play custom campaigns from other players for more fun.\n\nIn fact, for a free game a very impressive experience with great gameplay and much more aliens.", "timestamp_created": 1461285386, "timestamp_updated": 1461285386, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "22547635", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038663307", "personaname": "Elusive", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Elusivedelight/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 19342, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 18704, "last_played": 1683969086, "avatar": "217072048ae7abc65a1387f5c26b6cb53e6353c5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome game. Fun, genuinly requires teamwork to win, and overall one of a kind.\n\nThis is the best game you will never payfor.", "timestamp_created": 1461237556, "timestamp_updated": 1461237556, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count"